        {
          "type": "rich_text",
          "data": {
            "heading": "",
            "width": "narrow",
            "content": "<p>This policy explains how Vaidyagram Ayurveda Centre collects, uses and protects the personal information you share through this website.</p><h3>Information we collect</h3><p>When you request an appointment or send a message we collect your name, phone number, email address and the details you provide, such as the department and preferred date.</p><h3>How we use it</h3><p>We use this information only to respond to you and to arrange your care. Medical records are handled under applicable health-data regulations and are never shared for marketing.</p><h3>Contact</h3><p>For any privacy question, contact the hospital help desk using the details on the contact page.</p>"
          }
        }
      ]
